{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_arquitectura", "label": "arquitectura.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_visao_geral_so_github", "label": "Vis\u00e3o geral \u00abs\u00f3 GitHub\u00bb", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L3-L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O GitHub Pages n\u00e3o tem servidor e \u00e9 p\u00fablico, por isso s\u00f3 serve o c\u00f3digo da interface; os dados e o processamento vivem num reposit\u00f3rio privado e no respectivo Actions. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 base de dados central: o estado est\u00e1 em YAML e Markdown, leg\u00edveis, com diffs e f\u00e1ceis de fundir."}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_ramo_indices", "label": "Ramo indices (\u00f3rf\u00e3o, um s\u00f3 commit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L8, L25-L26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reescrito a cada execu\u00e7\u00e3o para n\u00e3o inchar o hist\u00f3rico."}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_sqlite_wasm", "label": "SQLite WASM em mem\u00f3ria no browser (cache IndexedDB)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_actions_worker", "label": "GitHub Actions como worker (concurrency)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L32-L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Uma execu\u00e7\u00e3o de cada vez."}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_ciclo_reconciliacao", "label": "Ciclo de reconcilia\u00e7\u00e3o idempotente", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L33-L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Calcula o que falta a partir do estado, por isso uma execu\u00e7\u00e3o interrompida ou repetida n\u00e3o estraga nada."}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_fluxo_deposito", "label": "Fluxo de dep\u00f3sito (browser para deposito/<login>/<lote>)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L38-L43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O browser calcula o SHA-256, ignora lixo de sistema e envia s\u00f3 uma refer\u00eancia se o conte\u00fado j\u00e1 existir; cada lote \u00e9 um \u00fanico commit que dispara o workflow."}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_pipeline_processar", "label": "Pipeline nexus processar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L45-L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_etapa_pedidos_catalogo", "label": "Etapa 1: pedidos de cat\u00e1logo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L48", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_etapa_recepcao", "label": "Etapa 2: recep\u00e7\u00e3o (deduplicar, desempacotar, extrair)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L49-L57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "S\u00f3 no fim, e se tudo correu bem, move o original para originais/; se falhar vai para _erros/ com um .log; se faltar uma ferramenta fica no dep\u00f3sito."}, {"id": "docs_arquitectura_etapa_reconciliacao", "label": "Etapa 3: reconcilia\u00e7\u00e3o (classificar, arrumar ou rever)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/arquitectura.md", "source_location": "L58-L62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contribu